a security and vault durability[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Close five prioritized task beads by removing Athena [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]privilege-boundary exposures, restricting monitoring access, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]preserving ignored vault content, and stabilizing annotation [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]identities. The lander continues the backlog through further epics [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]of at most five phases and five task beads until every project task[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bead is closed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]backlog_security_and_durability.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/backlog_security_and_durability.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-an[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-an/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Secure Athena supervisor control and its executable chain[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]supervisor[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]supervisor: resolve bob-cli-8u with restricted authenticated control, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]protected credentials, root-owned dependencies, and live verification.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove user-writable code from root hourly jobs[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-cron[dim] · [dim][/dim]after supervisor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-cron: resolve bob-cli-96 while preserving hourly jobs and backups [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and verifying their complete executable chains.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restrict monitoring endpoints to verified clients[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]monitoring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-cron[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]monitoring: resolve bob-cli-97 after inventorying scrapes, pushers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dashboards, and firewall policy; retain apt alerts and email delivery.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preserve ignored vault content off host[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-content[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-cron[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-content: resolve bob-cli-1g with an inventory, narrow ignore [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exceptions, durable copies, and a restore check, honoring the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]migration-material decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preserve highlight IDs across annotation insertion[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]highlight-identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]highlight-identity: resolve bob-cli-9o by preserving existing annotation[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identities before allocating new IDs, including folded annotations and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate-text cases.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-an","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-an.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-an.1"},"source_run_id":"run-135fa8abbdd3e0b1c6ec1488fcb54565","started_at":"2026-10-21T17:01:28.033310+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requi